24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:30,770 --> 00:01:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you guys?</font>

26
00:01:59,970 --> 00:02:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm in a bad mood right now.</font>

27
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you wanna continue to fight,</font>

28
00:02:05,850 --> 00:02:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't go easy on you.</font>

29
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You stop your babbling, weakling.</font>

30
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, come over here.</font>

31
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna play
do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do on you...</font>

32
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:24,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">while I snap your ribs!</font>

33
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it!</font>

34
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! He got both of my legs
with his string...!</font>

35
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:54,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you...!</font>

36
00:02:59,990 --> 00:03:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! Let's hear a nice sound.</font>

37
00:03:03,070 --> 00:03:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do!</font>

38
00:03:05,950 --> 00:03:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?!</font>

39
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:09,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Re!</font>

40
00:03:14,790 --> 00:03:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Where is he attacking from?!</font>

41
00:03:20,010 --> 00:03:23,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your bones make
a really low sound, don't they?</font>

42
00:03:25,010 --> 00:03:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hear a much sharper reverberation,
shall we?</font>

43
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right?</font>

44
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next I'll go for
a mi-fa-so tri-combination.</font>

45
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:03,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

46
00:04:07,850 --> 00:04:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

47
00:04:15,810 --> 00:04:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Last!</font>

48
00:04:19,650 --> 00:04:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lions Barrage!</font>

49
00:04:22,650 --> 00:04:28,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Sound's</font>

50
00:04:22,650 --> 00:04:28,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Invitation</font>

51
00:04:28,740 --> 00:04:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you are!</font>

52
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm digging in!</font>

53
00:04:34,670 --> 00:04:37,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan! Go on, eat, eat!</font>

54
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chinese-style barbecued pork
ramen noodles here are fabulous!</font>

55
00:04:42,970 --> 00:04:46,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry. It's my treat.</font>

56
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, chef?</font>

57
00:04:48,140 --> 00:04:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're gonna treat your girl.</font>

58
00:04:49,850 --> 00:04:51,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're growing up aren't you, Naruto?</font>

59
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Wh-What?!</font>

60
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:55,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What the heck are
you talking about?</font>

61
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to have an important conversation
with Sakura-chan today...</font>

62
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sh-She's not my girl
or anything like that...</font>

63
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan?</font>

64
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, Naruto. I was little spaced out.</font>

65
00:05:10,540 --> 00:05:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This looks delicious.</font>

66
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:14,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then... Let's eat! Let's eat!</font>

67
00:05:14,790 --> 00:05:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Tell me about Sasuke
while we eat.</font>

68
00:05:39,230 --> 00:05:43,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun told me not to tell you this
Naruto but...</font>

69
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:59,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all that guy Orochimaru's fault...</font>

70
00:06:04,710 --> 00:06:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop!</font>

71
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:19,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei said it would be fine
and I'd like to believe that too...</font>

72
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But when he was battling Gaara...</font>

73
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earlier today...</font>

74
00:06:32,450 --> 00:06:34,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun was wearing the same expression
as the time before.</font>

75
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:36,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I...</font>

76
00:06:43,790 --> 00:06:48,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru, huh?
I ran into him again a little while back.</font>

77
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? Where?!</font>

78
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:54,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I was searching for
Granny Tsunade...</font>

79
00:06:57,930 --> 00:06:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

80
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

81
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage and the old lady...</font>

82
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:17,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite the fact that
he was fighting two of them at once</font>

83
00:07:17,450 --> 00:07:19,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he was incredibly powerful.</font>

84
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's one dangerous dude.</font>

85
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That strong...</font>

86
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll all be fine.</font>

87
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:33,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke wouldn't fall to
that kind of guy's enticement.</font>

88
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:35,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's already a really powerful guy</font>

89
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so he wouldn't need to do
that kind of thing!</font>

90
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guarantee it!</font>

91
00:07:50,530 --> 00:07:51,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

92
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does Orochimaru-sama
want this guy anyway?</font>

93
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kimimaro would have
been much better...</font>

94
00:08:12,090 --> 00:08:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, if you stay in
a seedy place like this</font>

95
00:08:15,590 --> 00:08:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll just remain mediocre at best.</font>

96
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:21,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll never become strong...</font>

97
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Why...?</font>

98
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:27,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All my barrages were solid.
Yet this guy...</font>

99
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">doesn't seem to have
sustained any damage.</font>

100
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:33,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you keep on fooling around
playing Ninja with your friends</font>

101
00:08:33,780 --> 00:08:36,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're just gonna continue to rot.</font>

102
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come with us.</font>

103
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you do,
Orochimaru-sama will empower you.</font>

104
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no meaning
if we take you by force he said.</font>

105
00:08:55,050 --> 00:08:56,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You decide.</font>

106
00:08:58,260 --> 00:08:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break...</font>

107
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama sure sent me
on a bothersome mission.</font>

108
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What did you decide?</font>

109
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you coming?</font>

110
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or are you not coming?!</font>

111
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Decide already!</font>

112
00:09:13,820 --> 00:09:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a weakling like you lags</font>

113
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it makes me wanna just finish you!</font>

114
00:09:19,780 --> 00:09:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try me...!</font>

115
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:33,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... those Curse Marks...</font>

116
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so sure that</font>

117
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're the only favorite
of Orochimaru-sama.</font>

118
00:09:51,570 --> 00:09:54,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One shouldn't use Curse Marks
that lightly.</font>

119
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or rather... it looks like you're not
even able to control the Curse Marks.</font>

120
00:10:00,780 --> 00:10:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they continue to be released
for a long period of time</font>

121
00:10:03,490 --> 00:10:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Curse Marks will progressively
eat your body.</font>

122
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like you're still at first state</font>

123
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so the speed at which they will
eat away at you is still fairly slow.</font>

124
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But when they have entirely eaten you</font>

125
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:17,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will lose yourself.</font>

126
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:19,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forever.</font>

127
00:10:23,470 --> 00:10:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In exchange for having been
empowered by Curse Marks</font>

128
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will be tethered
by Orochimaru-sama.</font>

129
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:30,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We no longer have anything
like freedom.</font>

130
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to receive something
one must discard something.</font>

131
00:10:36,490 --> 00:10:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is your objective?</font>

132
00:10:38,950 --> 00:10:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you and your comrades
just going to comfort each other</font>

133
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in this lukewarm village...</font>

134
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then simply forget all about...</font>

135
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Itachi?</font>

136
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget your objective.</font>

137
00:10:54,170 --> 00:10:57,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kind of village does
nothing more than shackle you!</font>

138
00:10:57,840 --> 00:11:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut your stupid ties with this place.</font>

139
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you do that you'll...</font>

140
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:07,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">be able to obtain much
more fabulous power.</font>

141
00:11:08,430 --> 00:11:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget your objective!</font>

142
00:11:36,210 --> 00:11:37,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks!</font>

143
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey, Sakura-chan.</font>

144
00:11:39,130 --> 00:11:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll walk you home!</font>

145
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Don't worry about it.</font>

146
00:11:41,970 --> 00:11:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why, why?
The streets are dangerous at night!</font>

147
00:11:47,430 --> 00:11:49,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're well lit so I'll be fine...</font>

148
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan?</font>

149
00:12:00,570 --> 00:12:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks Naruto.</font>

150
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:04,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I want to go home alone tonight.</font>

151
00:12:05,780 --> 00:12:06,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

152
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:08,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be fine!</font>

153
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:11,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

154
00:13:47,590 --> 00:13:51,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you hanging around in a place
like this in the middle of the night?</font>

155
00:13:52,970 --> 00:13:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One has to pass down this road
to leave the village.</font>

156
00:13:58,270 --> 00:13:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go home and sleep.</font>

157
00:14:13,950 --> 00:14:15,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...</font>

158
00:14:16,710 --> 00:14:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why won't you tell me anything?</font>

159
00:14:20,210 --> 00:14:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you always silent like that?</font>

160
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't tell me one single thing.</font>

161
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should I have to tell you anything?!</font>

162
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you to keep your nose
out of my business.</font>

163
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop bothering me
over everything I do.</font>

164
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... make you dislike me
all the time, don't I?</font>

165
00:14:45,730 --> 00:14:46,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember?</font>

166
00:14:47,950 --> 00:14:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We just became Genin and
the Three-Man Teams were assigned...</font>

167
00:14:53,370 --> 00:14:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and I were alone for
the first time here at this very spot.</font>

168
00:14:58,540 --> 00:14:59,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got mad at me.</font>

169
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See! That guy doesn't
have parents, right?</font>

170
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:07,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's all alone and he doesn't have to deal
with parents lecturing him...</font>

171
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:09,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why he can sometimes
be selfish!</font>

172
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Solitude...</font>

173
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:14,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

174
00:15:15,890 --> 00:15:18,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it the same as being
scolded by one's parents.</font>

175
00:15:19,850 --> 00:15:21,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter all of a sudden...</font>

176
00:15:23,230 --> 00:15:25,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... are annoying...</font>

177
00:15:41,250 --> 00:15:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't remember that.</font>

178
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I guess...
that was long ago after all...</font>

179
00:15:54,140 --> 00:15:56,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it all began that day.</font>

180
00:15:57,060 --> 00:15:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun and me...</font>

181
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also Naruto and Kakashi-sensei...</font>

182
00:16:25,250 --> 00:16:27,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The four of us went
on various missions, didn't we?</font>

183
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those were tough and
difficult times but...</font>

184
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

185
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">more than anything...</font>

186
00:16:56,530 --> 00:16:57,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was so much fun!</font>

187
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know about your family, Sasuke-kun...</font>

188
00:17:08,210 --> 00:17:10,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But revenge...</font>

189
00:17:12,710 --> 00:17:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that won't bring anyone happiness.</font>

190
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one...</font>

191
00:17:18,850 --> 00:17:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neither you...</font>

192
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nor I.</font>

193
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I expected...</font>

194
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm different from you guys...</font>

195
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm walking a road that's incompatible
with the rest of you.</font>

196
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:39,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The four of us worked together...</font>

197
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:43,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it's true that there was a time
when I thought that was my road.</font>

198
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:46,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The four of us have worked together</font>

199
00:17:46,710 --> 00:17:49,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but in the end
I decided on revenge.</font>

200
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:53,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's been my reason for living.</font>

201
00:17:57,470 --> 00:17:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't become like
you and Naruto.</font>

202
00:18:00,300 --> 00:18:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to isolate
yourself again, Sasuke-kun?!</font>

203
00:18:03,470 --> 00:18:06,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You taught me that solitude
is a very rough thing that time, Sasuke-kun!</font>

204
00:18:08,020 --> 00:18:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I know exactly how that feels.</font>

205
00:18:11,060 --> 00:18:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have both family and friends...</font>

206
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you were no longer here, Sasuke-kun...</font>

207
00:18:18,490 --> 00:18:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for me...</font>

208
00:18:20,620 --> 00:18:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for me it would be the same as solitude.</font>

209
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here again...</font>

210
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we're going to start walking
our new paths individually.</font>

211
00:18:36,590 --> 00:18:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...!</font>

212
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:41,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love you so very very much, Sasuke-kun!</font>

213
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you would only be with me, Sasuke-kun,</font>

214
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:46,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you regret it
no matter what!</font>

215
00:18:46,810 --> 00:18:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make it fun every day and
you will definitely find happiness!</font>

216
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do anything for you, Sasuke-kun!</font>

217
00:18:55,690 --> 00:18:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... I'm begging you,
please stay here!</font>

218
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll even help you with your revenge!</font>

219
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make it happen somehow
I promise you...!</font>

220
00:19:05,790 --> 00:19:09,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So stay here... with me...!</font>

221
00:19:12,330 --> 00:19:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that doesn't work for you...</font>

222
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then take me with you...</font>

223
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really are... annoying.</font>

224
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't go!</font>

225
00:19:35,690 --> 00:19:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you go I'll scream and...</font>

226
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

227
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

228
00:20:05,930 --> 00:20:08,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

229
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were waiting for you, Sasuke-sama.</font>

230
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your intention?</font>

231
00:20:31,330 --> 00:20:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was already decided that
you would be our leader</font>

232
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the moment you exited the village.</font>

233
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive our rudeness
up to now.</font>

234
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care about any of that.</font>

235
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:55,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

236
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the beginning!</font>

