<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b></b></font></font></font>

271
00:22:38,870 --> 00:22:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What? That jerk Sasuke.</font>

272
00:22:41,670 --> 00:22:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What the hell is he thinking?
He has such a twisted personality!</font>

273
00:22:45,170 --> 00:22:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What is it that he disliked so much
that he'd do something like this?!</font>

274
00:22:48,090 --> 00:22:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn! I'm not about to let that guy
do whatever he wants!</font>

275
00:22:52,930 --> 00:22:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If things come to this I'll chase him
down to the end of the world.</font>

276
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll drag that guy back
even if I have to grab him by his neck!</font>

277
